      "rotation": 0,
      "raw_text": "Hrs 01-feb-2015\n00:00 - 03:00 3.00 PERFORO DIRECCIONAL CON BNA PDC 10 5/8\" + PD + HTTA MWD + RHINO REAMER 12 1/4\" A LA PROFUNDIDAD DE 5712MTS A 5719 MTS (AMPLIANDO A 5691 MTS). CON PSB: 12-15 TON, 110-135 RPM, 14,000/16,500 FT-LB, 130 EPM, 500 GPM, 3900 PSI.\nNOTA1: PERFORANDO EL METRO 5717M, OBSERVO DISMINUCIÓN EN EL TIEMPO DE PENETRACIÓN DE 9 MIN POR METRO. POSTERIORMENTE PERFORO METRO A METRO DE 5717M HASTA 5719M LEVANTANDO SARTA POR SEGURIDAD LEVANTANDO LIBRE. PARÁMETROS CONTROLADOS DE TORQUE 17,000-19,000 FT-LB Y PSB: 5 TON.\nNOTA2: OBSERVO RESISTENCIA PARA REGRESAR AL FONDO DESDE 5718.6 HASTA 5719M CON TORQUE DE 17,000 - 19,000 FT-LB.\nNOTA3: DECIDIO LEVANTAR SARTA A 5690M PARA RECUPERAR MUESTRA DE FONDO Y CARACTERIZAR CON GEOLOGÍA.\n03:00 - 06:00 3.00 LEVANTO SARTA Y BARRENA DE 10 5/8\" A DE 5,719 A 5,692 M PARA CIRCULAR POZO Y RECUPERAR MUESTRA DE FONDO Y CARACTERIZAR POR GEOLOGÍA.\n06:00 - 00:00 18.00 PERFORO DIRECCIONAL CON BNA PDC 10 5/8\" + PD + HTTA MWD + RHINO REAMER 12 1/4\" DESDE 5,719 MTS HASTA 5752 MTS (AMPLIANDO A 5724 MTS). CON PSB: 6-10 TON, 130 RPM, 14,000/16,500 FT-LB, 130 EPM, 500 GPM, 4000 PSI.\nRECORD BNA: 352 M EN 166:00 HRS. RHINO: 318 M EN 144:44 HRS. ULT.3.MTS: 36' - 32' - 44'. PROM: 32.78 MIN/M.\nNOTA: INCREMENTO DENSIDAD DE LODO DE 2.0 GR/CC A 2.02 GR/CC.\nNOTA1: LEVANTO CON CIRCULACION Y SIN ROTACION A 5,712 M PARA VERIFICAR PESOS, LIBRE. PESOS DE SARTA: ESTATICO 206 TON, ARRIBA 222 TON, TQ FUERA DE FONDO 13,500 FT-LB.\nNOTA2: SUSPENDE POR OBTENER 100 HRS CONTINUAS DE PERFORACION PARA REALIZAR VIAJE DE CORTO DE ACUERDO A PROGRAMA.\nNOTA3: OBSERVO PERDIDA DE SENAL DE LA HTTA MWD A 5752M. REALIZO PRUEBA ANTIJAMMING RECUPERANDO SENAL DE LAS HERRAMIENTAS (MWD) SATISFACTORIAMENTE.\n* LODO PERDIDO DIA: 0 M3. * ACUMULADO ETAPA: 527:4 M3. *UNIDADES DE GAS: 10\n**MANTIENE EN EL SISTEMA CIRCULANTE 15 KG/M3 DE CACO 3 M-200 Y 2 LT/M3 DE VERSACOAT.",
      "translated_text": "Hrs 01-feb-2015\n00:00 - 03:00 3.00 DIRECTIONAL DRILLING WITH PDC BIT 10 5/8\" + PD + HTTA MWD + RHINO REAMER 12 1/4\" AT DEPTH FROM 5712MTS TO 5719 MTS (REAMING TO 5691 MTS). WITH WOB: 12-15 TON, 110-135 RPM, 14,000/16,500 FT-LB, 130 EPM, 500 GPM, 3900 PSI.\nNOTE1: DRILLING METER 5717M, OBSERVED DECREASE IN PENETRATION TIME OF 9 MIN PER METER. SUBSEQUENTLY DRILLED METER BY METER FROM 5717M TO 5719M PULLING STRING FOR SAFETY, PULLING FREE. CONTROLLED TORQUE PARAMETERS 17,000-19,000 FT-LB AND WOB: 5 TON.\nNOTE2: OBSERVED RESISTANCE TO RETURN TO BOTTOM FROM 5718.6 TO 5719M WITH TORQUE OF 17,000 - 19,000 FT-LB.\nNOTE3: DECIDED TO PULL STRING TO 5690M TO RECOVER BOTTOM SAMPLE AND CHARACTERIZE WITH GEOLOGY.\n03:00 - 06:00 3.00 PULLED STRING AND BIT OF 10 5/8\" FROM 5,719 TO 5,692 M TO CIRCULATE WELL AND RECOVER BOTTOM SAMPLE AND CHARACTERIZE BY GEOLOGY.\n06:00 - 00:00 18.00 DIRECTIONAL DRILLING WITH PDC BIT 10 5/8\" + PD + HTTA MWD + RHINO REAMER 12 1/4\" FROM 5,719 MTS TO 5752 MTS (REAMING TO 5724 MTS). WITH WOB: 6-10 TON, 130 RPM, 14,000/16,500 FT-LB, 130 EPM, 500 GPM, 4000 PSI.\nBIT RECORD: 352 M IN 166:00 HRS. RHINO: 318 M IN 144:44 HRS. LAST 3 MTS: 36' - 32' - 44'. AVG: 32.78 MIN/M.\nNOTE: INCREASED MUD DENSITY FROM 2.0 GR/CC TO 2.02 GR/CC.\nNOTE1: PULLED WITH CIRCULATION AND WITHOUT ROTATION TO 5,712 M TO VERIFY WEIGHTS, FREE. STRING WEIGHTS: STATIC 206 TON, PULL 222 TON, OFF-BOTTOM TORQUE 13,500 FT-LB.\nNOTE2: SUSPENDED AFTER OBTAINING 100 CONTINUOUS DRILLING HOURS TO MAKE SHORT TRIP ACCORDING TO PROGRAM.\nNOTE3: OBSERVED LOSS OF SIGNAL FROM HTTA MWD AT 5752M. PERFORMED ANTI-JAMMING TEST RECOVERING TOOL SIGNAL (MWD) SATISFACTORILY.\n* MUD LOST DAY: 0 M3. * ACCUMULATED STAGE: 527:4 M3. *GAS UNITS: 10\n**MAINTAINS IN CIRCULATING SYSTEM 15 KG/M3 OF CACO 3 M-200 AND 2 LT/M3 OF VERSACOAT.",
